{
 "id": "as-armenia-030",
 "title": {
  "id": "title",
  "source": "Sia-Manto And Guje-Zare"
 },
 "tradition": "Armenia",
 "continent": "Asia",
 "source_lang": "en",
 "source_book": "The Golden Maiden, and other folk tales and fairy stories told in Armenia",
 "credits": "Seklemian, A. G. (Apraham Garabed) (author, d. 1920)",
 "gutenberg": "Project Gutenberg eBook #46944 — https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/46944",
 "copyright": "Public domain worldwide: the text was published long ago and every named author/translator died in or before 1955.",
 "markdown_file": "Asia/Armenia/030 - Sia-Manto And Guje-Zare.md",
 "stats": {
  "paragraphs": 188,
  "segments": 216,
  "words": 1501
 },
 "paragraphs": [
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p001.s01",
     "source": "It chanced that Sia-Manto in a dream"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p001"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p002.s01",
     "source": "Saw Guje-Zare; in his dream it seemed"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p002"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p003.s01",
     "source": "They were troth-plighted, and exchanged their rings."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p003"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p004.s01",
     "source": "To Guje-Zare the same dream befell"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p004"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p005.s01",
     "source": "On the same night."
    },
    {
     "id": "p005.s02",
     "source": "Then Sia-Manto rose"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p005"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p006.s01",
     "source": "Long before dawn, and, mounting on his steed—"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p006"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p007.s01",
     "source": "Red, spirited, a horse of lightning—rode"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p007"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p008.s01",
     "source": "Swift as an eagle to his sweetheart’s tribe."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p008"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p009.s01",
     "source": "An aged dame received him in her tent."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p009"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p010.s01",
     "source": "Lo! drums were beating, trumpets sounding loud."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p010"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p011.s01",
     "source": "“Why is this mirth, and whose the festival?”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p011"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p012.s01",
     "source": "He asked of his good hostess, the old dame."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p012"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p013.s01",
     "source": "“’Tis Guje-Zare’s wedding, O my son,”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p013"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p014.s01",
     "source": "She answered, “and the bridegroom from afar"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p014"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p015.s01",
     "source": "Has come to bear her with him to his home."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p015"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p016.s01",
     "source": "This is the third day of the festival.”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p016"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p017.s01",
     "source": "Then Sia-Manto prayed with tearful eyes,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p017"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p018.s01",
     "source": "Saying, “A token bear to her from me;”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p018"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p019.s01",
     "source": "And from his finger drew and gave the ring"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p019"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p020.s01",
     "source": "Exchanged with Guje-Zare in his dream."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p020"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p021.s01",
     "source": "The old dame took a kerchief many-hued,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p021"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p022.s01",
     "source": "Put raisins in it, and with them the ring."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p022"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p023.s01",
     "source": "Then to the bride she went, and wished her joy."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p023"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p024.s01",
     "source": "The lovely girl received her and her gift;"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p024"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p025.s01",
     "source": "With fingers dyed with henna, she turned o’er"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p025"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p026.s01",
     "source": "And stirred the raisins; and among them, lo!"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p026"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p027.s01",
     "source": "The ring of the betrothal of her dream!"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p027"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p028.s01",
     "source": "She knew it at a glance; deeply she sighed;"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p028"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p029.s01",
     "source": "She paled, her eyes were darkened, and she swooned."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p029"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p030.s01",
     "source": "The old dame held her, and with sorrow said:"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p030"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p031.s01",
     "source": "“O Guje-Zare! would I had been blind"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p031"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p032.s01",
     "source": "And had not seen this sight!"
    },
    {
     "id": "p032.s02",
     "source": "What is thy pain?"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p032"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p033.s01",
     "source": "Dear soul, what ails thee?"
    },
    {
     "id": "p033.s02",
     "source": "Ope thine eyes, thy lips!"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p033"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p034.s01",
     "source": "Tell me, what hast thou seen?"
    },
    {
     "id": "p034.s02",
     "source": "What moves thee thus?”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p034"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p035.s01",
     "source": "The voice of sympathy, the dame’s warm touch,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p035"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p036.s01",
     "source": "Roused Guje-Zare; faintly thus she spake:"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p036"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p037.s01",
     "source": "“O auntie, I implore thee, tell me true"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p037"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p038.s01",
     "source": "Where dwells the owner of this golden ring?”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p038"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p039.s01",
     "source": "“A guest within my tent,” replied the dame."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p039"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p040.s01",
     "source": "Then Guje-Zare, sighing, said, “Behold,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p040"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p041.s01",
     "source": "Of the festivities three days are past;"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p041"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p042.s01",
     "source": "To-morrow is the bridal’s final day."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p042"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p043.s01",
     "source": "Let Sia-Manto know there is one chance,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p043"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p044.s01",
     "source": "But one; to-morrow morning I shall go"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p044"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p045.s01",
     "source": "Unto my mother’s tomb; alone I go"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p045"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p046.s01",
     "source": "To weep there, and to bid her bones farewell."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p046"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p047.s01",
     "source": "There may he come and find me."
    },
    {
     "id": "p047.s02",
     "source": "Tell him this.”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p047"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p048.s01",
     "source": "The dame to Sia-Manto told her tale."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p048"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p049.s01",
     "source": "That night long, Sia-Manto could not sleep."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p049"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p050.s01",
     "source": "Ere dawn he rose, and hastened to the place."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p050"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p051.s01",
     "source": "There, ‘neath the silent dome, sleep fell on him."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p051"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p052.s01",
     "source": "He wrapped his cloak about him, slept, and snored."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p052"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p053.s01",
     "source": "Soon Guje-Zare came; and lo! he slept."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p053"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p054.s01",
     "source": "She stood there long, and long she gazed on him;"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p054"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p055.s01",
     "source": "Pitying, she did not touch him."
    },
    {
     "id": "p055.s02",
     "source": "Sound he slept,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p055"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p056.s01",
     "source": "And loud he snored, while by his side she stood."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p056"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p057.s01",
     "source": "She blamed him, and condemned him in her heart;"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p057"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p058.s01",
     "source": "Two golden marbles from her pocket drew,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p058"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p059.s01",
     "source": "And put them in his pocket, and went home."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p059"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p060.s01",
     "source": "’Twas noon when Sia-Manto woke from sleep."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p060"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p061.s01",
     "source": "He looked around and beat his head, and came"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p061"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p062.s01",
     "source": "Again to his kind hostess."
    },
    {
     "id": "p062.s02",
     "source": "Mournfully,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p062"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p063.s01",
     "source": "With broken heart, thus spake he to the dame:"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p063"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p064.s01",
     "source": "“Auntie, I sought the tomb; she was not there."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p064"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p065.s01",
     "source": "I slept there; when I woke I was alone.”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p065"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p066.s01",
     "source": "“Ah!” said the dame."
    },
    {
     "id": "p066.s02",
     "source": "“Hast thou no token, look"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p066"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p067.s01",
     "source": "Within thy pocket?”"
    },
    {
     "id": "p067.s02",
     "source": "And he looked, and lo!"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p067"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p068.s01",
     "source": "The pair of golden marbles."
    },
    {
     "id": "p068.s02",
     "source": "“This,” she said,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p068"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p069.s01",
     "source": "“Is Guje-Zare’s token.”"
    },
    {
     "id": "p069.s02",
     "source": "“But,” he asked,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p069"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p070.s01",
     "source": "“What does it mean?”"
    },
    {
     "id": "p070.s02",
     "source": "“By this,” the matron said,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p070"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p071.s01",
     "source": "“She meant, ‘I see thou yet art but a boy,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p071"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p072.s01",
     "source": "And not a man of love."
    },
    {
     "id": "p072.s02",
     "source": "Go play with boys;"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p072"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p073.s01",
     "source": "This undertaking is too great for thee.’”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p073"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p074.s01",
     "source": "Then Sia-Manto blushed with shame."
    },
    {
     "id": "p074.s02",
     "source": "In tears"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p074"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p075.s01",
     "source": "He begged the dame, “Go, auntie, go once more,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p075"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p076.s01",
     "source": "For Heaven’s sake, and let her speak to thee"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p076"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p077.s01",
     "source": "A last word."
    },
    {
     "id": "p077.s02",
     "source": "What she bids me, I will do.”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p077"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p078.s01",
     "source": "The dame from Guje-Zare brought this word:"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p078"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p079.s01",
     "source": "“To-morrow is the bridal’s closing day,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p079"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p080.s01",
     "source": "The day of the procession."
    },
    {
     "id": "p080.s02",
     "source": "At that time"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p080"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p081.s01",
     "source": "The bridegroom and his men will bear me hence."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p081"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p082.s01",
     "source": "If Sia-Manto is a man, and knows"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p082"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p083.s01",
     "source": "How to be loved, and love, let him come then,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p083"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p084.s01",
     "source": "Full armed from head to foot, upon his steed,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p084"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p085.s01",
     "source": "And take me."
    },
    {
     "id": "p085.s02",
     "source": "We will go to Ararat,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p085"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p086.s01",
     "source": "And rest and love there, hidden in the mist.”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p086"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p087.s01",
     "source": "Next morning, when the bridal train set forth,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p087"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p088.s01",
     "source": "The bridegroom, with his forty horsemen, armed"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p088"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p089.s01",
     "source": "From head to foot, rode, bearing home the bride."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p089"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p090.s01",
     "source": "And then like lightning Sia-Manto came,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p090"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p091.s01",
     "source": "And snatched the bride, and set her on his steed;"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p091"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p092.s01",
     "source": "And swifter rode he than the eagle flies"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p092"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p093.s01",
     "source": "Chasing a dove; a journey of three days"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p093"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p094.s01",
     "source": "Was all passed over in that one wild ride."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p094"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p095.s01",
     "source": "With the same swiftness the pursuers rode."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p095"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p096.s01",
     "source": "The rider on the gray steed nearest pressed."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p096"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p097.s01",
     "source": "“Who is it,” Sia-Manto asked his love,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p097"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p098.s01",
     "source": "“That risks his own life and his horse’s thus?”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p098"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p099.s01",
     "source": "“’Tis he,” she answered, “from whom thou hast reft"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p099"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p100.s01",
     "source": "His plighted bride, the maid whom he had loved"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p100"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p101.s01",
     "source": "A year and longer."
    },
    {
     "id": "p101.s02",
     "source": "Do not blame him, dear;"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p101"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p102.s01",
     "source": "His heart is broken; he is full of rage.”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p102"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p103.s01",
     "source": "He lifted Guje-Zare from the horse,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p103"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p104.s01",
     "source": "And spread his cloak, and set her there to rest;"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p104"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p105.s01",
     "source": "Then, mounting, took his arrows and his sword,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p105"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p106.s01",
     "source": "And furiously on the pursuers fell,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p106"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p107.s01",
     "source": "And slew the forty horsemen and their steeds."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p107"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p108.s01",
     "source": "Then he returned, and Guje-Zare bore"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p108"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p109.s01",
     "source": "Unto Mount Ararat, where they reposed,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p109"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p110.s01",
     "source": "Hid in thick mist and fog."
    },
    {
     "id": "p110.s02",
     "source": "His weary head"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p110"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p111.s01",
     "source": "He laid in her soft lap, and fell asleep."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p111"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p112.s01",
     "source": "Soon Sia-Manto started suddenly;"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p112"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p113.s01",
     "source": "Warm tears had fallen from Guje-Zare’s eyes"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p113"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p114.s01",
     "source": "Upon his face, and wakened him from sleep."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p114"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p115.s01",
     "source": "“What is it, dear?” he said."
    },
    {
     "id": "p115.s02",
     "source": "“What hast thou seen?"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p115"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p116.s01",
     "source": "Tell me, why dost thou weep and tremble so?”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p116"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p117.s01",
     "source": "“In this wild place a wonder I have seen."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p117"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p118.s01",
     "source": "Forty wild bulls there were that came to drink"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p118"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p119.s01",
     "source": "At yonder spring, and with them was one cow."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p119"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p120.s01",
     "source": "Then raged a fearful fight among the bulls;"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p120"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p121.s01",
     "source": "And the gray bull, victorious o’er the rest,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p121"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p122.s01",
     "source": "Took him the cow."
    },
    {
     "id": "p122.s02",
     "source": "The thing reminded me"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p122"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p123.s01",
     "source": "Of our own case—the forty horsemen slain—"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p123"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p124.s01",
     "source": "And I was so excited that I wept.”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p124"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p125.s01",
     "source": "He rose and took his arrow and his bow,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p125"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p126.s01",
     "source": "Chased the gray bull, and shot it, and it fell,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p126"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p127.s01",
     "source": "And rolled upon the ground."
    },
    {
     "id": "p127.s02",
     "source": "He rushed on it,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p127"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p128.s01",
     "source": "And with his dagger strove to cut its throat;"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p128"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p129.s01",
     "source": "But the bull, bellowing madly, tossed its horns,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p129"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p130.s01",
     "source": "And threw him down the precipice profound."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p130"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p131.s01",
     "source": "And Sia-Manto fell upon his back"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p131"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p132.s01",
     "source": "Upon a sharp oak trunk, that pierced his chest"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p132"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p133.s01",
     "source": "Four spans and further."
    },
    {
     "id": "p133.s02",
     "source": "There he hung transfixed."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p133"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p134.s01",
     "source": "Then Guje-Zare, following him afar,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p134"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p135.s01",
     "source": "Came to the precipice, and gazed around;"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p135"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p136.s01",
     "source": "Saw the wild bull in its last agony,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p136"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p137.s01",
     "source": "And heard her Sia-Manto’s mournful groans."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p137"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p138.s01",
     "source": "She found his bow and arrow, picked them up,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p138"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p139.s01",
     "source": "And bent her o’er the precipice’s edge"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p139"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p140.s01",
     "source": "Until she saw where Sia-Manto hung."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p140"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p141.s01",
     "source": "She tore her hair, and wailed this loud lament:"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p141"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p142.s01",
     "source": "“O Sia-Manto, dost thou lie so low?"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p142"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p143.s01",
     "source": "Thy bow and arrow of pure silver are."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p143"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p144.s01",
     "source": "Thou hadst no need to follow the wild bull."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p144"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p145.s01",
     "source": "Oh, groan not, Sia-Manto, groan not so!”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p145"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p146.s01",
     "source": "“My Guje-Zare,” from below he called,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p146"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p147.s01",
     "source": "“Weep not!"
    },
    {
     "id": "p147.s02",
     "source": "Thy wailing causes me more pain"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p147"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p148.s01",
     "source": "Than this curst oak trunk.”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p148"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p149.s01",
     "source": "“But thou groanest there,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p149"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p150.s01",
     "source": "My Sia-Manto, and shall I not weep?"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p150"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p151.s01",
     "source": "Thy groans, that pierce my heart, call forth my tears."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p151"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p152.s01",
     "source": "There is a great storm on Mount Ararat."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p152"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p153.s01",
     "source": "Here are thy bow and arrow, O my love."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p153"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p154.s01",
     "source": "Thou didst not heed me when I prayed to thee."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p154"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p155.s01",
     "source": "‘Nay, lay thy bow and arrow down,’ I said;"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p155"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p156.s01",
     "source": "‘Chase not the wild bull, he too has his mate;"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p156"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p157.s01",
     "source": "Nay, let them live, like us, and love, like us.’"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p157"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p158.s01",
     "source": "O thou wild bull, thou fearful, cruel bull,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p158"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p159.s01",
     "source": "Thy horns are steel, thou huge and dreadful bull"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p159"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p160.s01",
     "source": "That didst part lovers on Mount Ararat."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p160"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p161.s01",
     "source": "The top of Ararat is wrapt in mist;"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p161"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p162.s01",
     "source": "And Sia-Manto’s bow and arrow gleam"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p162"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p163.s01",
     "source": "Like pearls."
    },
    {
     "id": "p163.s02",
     "source": "Alas! who ever heard before"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p163"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p164.s01",
     "source": "Of game that killed its hunter?"
    },
    {
     "id": "p164.s02",
     "source": "O my love,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p164"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p165.s01",
     "source": "I told thee, ‘Sia-Manto, do not go;"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p165"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p166.s01",
     "source": "Let the wild bull go after his own love."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p166"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p167.s01",
     "source": "Dost thou need game, I am enough for thee."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p167"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p168.s01",
     "source": "Oh, do not, do not go!’"
    },
    {
     "id": "p168.s02",
     "source": "Yet who can tell?"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p168"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p169.s01",
     "source": "Perchance ’twas Heaven that had ordained it thus."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p169"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p170.s01",
     "source": "The Will above cannot be changed below."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p170"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p171.s01",
     "source": "Rocky and bushy is Mount Ararat,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p171"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p172.s01",
     "source": "And cold and deadly are its winds and storms."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p172"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p173.s01",
     "source": "O Sia-Manto! show me now a way"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p173"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p174.s01",
     "source": "To reach thee where thou art, that I once more"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p174"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p175.s01",
     "source": "May hold thee in my arms, and die with thee."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p175"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p176.s01",
     "source": "Oh, hither come with shovels and with spades"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p176"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p177.s01",
     "source": "To turn the earth and rocks, and bury here"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p177"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p178.s01",
     "source": "Both Sia-Manto and his love with him!”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p178"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p179.s01",
     "source": "She shut her eyes, and casting herself down,"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p179"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p180.s01",
     "source": "Fell on her lover, uttering but one word—"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p180"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p181.s01",
     "source": "“My Sia-Manto!” and he echoed it—"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p181"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p182.s01",
     "source": "“My Guje-Zare!” with his latest breath."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p182"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p183.s01",
     "source": "Then silence!"
    },
    {
     "id": "p183.s02",
     "source": "In each other’s arms they died."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p183"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p184.s01",
     "source": "There in the Spring men still may see two flowers"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p184"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p185.s01",
     "source": "Bud forth, twin blossoms, like as like can be:"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p185"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p186.s01",
     "source": "Two butterflies come there to light on them."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p186"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p187.s01",
     "source": "They represent the hapless lovers twain"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p187"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p188.s01",
     "source": "Who lost their lives upon Mount Ararat."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p188"
  }
 ]
}